            "code": "```java\nprivate boolean runDependentValidators(final ValidatorAction va, final ValidatorResults results, final Map<String, ValidatorAction> actions, final Map<String, Object> params, final int pos) throws ValidatorException  {\n    final List<String> dependentValidators = va.getDependencyList();\n    if (dependentValidators.isEmpty())\n    {\n        return true;\n    }\n    for (final String depend : dependentValidators)\n    {\n        final ValidatorAction action = actions.get(depend);\n        if (action == null)\n        {\n            handleMissingAction(depend);\n        }\n        if (!validateForRule(action, results, actions, params, pos))\n        {\n            return false;\n        }\n    }\n    return true;\n}\n```"
