            "code": "```java\nprivate boolean validateForRule(final ValidatorAction va, final ValidatorResults results, final Map<String, ValidatorAction> actions, final Map<String, Object> params, final int pos) throws ValidatorException  {\n    final ValidatorResult result = results.getValidatorResult(getKey());\n    if (result != null && result.containsAction(va.getName()))\n    {\n        return result.isValid(va.getName());\n    }\n    if (!runDependentValidators(va, results, actions, params, pos))\n    {\n        return false;\n    }\n    return va.executeValidationMethod(this, params, results, pos);\n}\n```"
