            "is_getter_or_setter": false,
            "code": "```java\nprotected List<String> tokenize(final char[] srcChars, final int offset, final int count)  {\n    if (srcChars == null || count == 0)\n    {\n        return Collections.emptyList();\n    }\n    final StrBuilder buf = new StrBuilder();\n    final List<String> tokenList = new ArrayList<>();\n    int pos = offset;\n    // loop around the entire buffer while (pos >= 0 && pos < count)\n    {\n        // find next token pos = readNextToken(srcChars, pos, count, buf, tokenList);\n        // handle case where end of string is a delimiter if (pos >= count)\n        {\n            addToken(tokenList, StringUtils.EMPTY);\n        }\n    }\n    return tokenList;\n}\n```"
